    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37186" root="كلح" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُلَاحٌ</span></b>  (S, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلَاحِ</span></b> , the latter [indecl.]
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَطَامِ</span>, (K,) (tropical:)  <i>A year of dearth, scarcity,
drought, sterility,</i> or <i>barrenness.</i> (S, K.) You
say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصَابَتْهُمْ سَنَةٌ كُلَاحٌ</span> <i>A year of dearth, &amp;c.,
befell them.</i> (TA.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَالِحٌ</span>.

